摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH 会话生命周期管理插件：one-shot 子代理自动清理 + 容量保底 + 连带清理 projcache，从源头杜绝缓存膨胀卡顿","id":"gh:1339549728","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-pruner","slug":"mrzhangkris/dsh-session-pruner","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH 会话生命周期管理插件：one-shot 子代理自动清理 + 容量保底 + 连带清理 projcache，从源头杜绝缓存膨胀卡顿"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-pruner"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DSH session lifecycle management plugin** — full-type session lifecycle management: one-shot subag"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ents archived on completion, continuable subagents and main sessions archived when idle, a capacity "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"cap, and projection-cache cleanup. Prevents session-library accumulation stalls at the source."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Every session type has a defined destination: finished one-shot subagents are archived automatical"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ly, idle continuable subagents / main sessions are archived, and overflow is recycled by priority. *"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"*Archive first (recoverable), delete after expiry** — the GUI syncs within 30s, fully panel-configur"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"overable), delete after expiry** — the GUI syncs within 30s, fully panel-configured with hot reload."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"简体中文 · Apache-2.0 · npm · [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-session-pruner) · Changelog"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DSH (DeepSeek Harness) caches a full projection of every session in `session_projcache.json` (token "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"stats, context pressure, ...), and the storage backend rewrites the whole file atomically on **every"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"** write. When the session library accumulates thousands of subagent sessions:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- The cache balloons past 100MB and each checkpoint fully re-serializes → main process CPU 250%+\n- T"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"he single-threaded event loop is saturated → **every session load stalls, even `GET /` times out**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Managing session lifecycle (this plugin) is the root fix: no session accumulation → no cache rows → "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ession lifecycle (this plugin) is the root fix: no session accumulation → no cache rows → no stalls."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features: full-type lifecycle"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Session type | Trigger | Action | Default |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **one-shot subagent** | `subagent/end` / `agent/disposed` event (+ grace) | archive within seconds"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" (event-driven) | event + 3min grace |\n| **continuable subagent** | idle over N days | archive (reco"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"verable) | off (0 days) |\n| **main session** | idle over N days | archive (recoverable) | off (0 day"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s) |\n| **any type** | total exceeds capacity cap | recycle by `one-shot → continuable → main` + olde"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"st | 400 |\n| **archive directory** | kept over N hours | physically deleted | 24 hours |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> **Behavior note (v0.2.3+)**: one-shot subagents are archived uniformly by the `oneShotMinAgeMinute"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"s` idle threshold (default 3 minutes), with or without end-seed. The earlier fallback — \"one-shot se"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ssions without end-seed must stay idle a full hour before archiving\" — has been removed."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Archive mechanism (recoverable)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Cleaned sessions are **moved to `~/.dsh/sessions-archive/`** first (workspace/session-id structure p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"reserved) — they disappear from the GUI immediately (the list only reads the sessions directory), bu"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"t the files remain and can be restored manually:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"A \"delete directly\" mode (no archive, irreversible) is also available."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Safety (double protection)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Running sessions are never touched**: live sessions (still held in the in-memory session store, "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"open/loading) are skipped — and the live check is **fail-closed**: a store query error treats the se"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ssion as live, never deleting on uncertainty\n- **Idle = last log write**: idle is judged by the sess"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ion log file mtime (last write time), not the directory mtime — DSH appends to `session.jsonl.zstd`,"},{"id":"p19s5","text":" so active sessions keep refreshing their mtime and are never misjudged idle\n- **one-shot**: finishe"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"d one-shot subagents are archived uniformly by the `oneShotMinAgeMinutes` idle threshold (with or wi"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"thout end-seed, same threshold); the capacity cap additionally skips sessions lacking `session/end-s"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"eed`\n- Main sessions do not participate in capacity recycling by default (configurable)\n- Per-action"},{"id":"p19s9","text":" failure isolation: every action is try/catch wrapped"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"GUI sync — change-driven primary, full-refresh fallback:\n- **dirty-flag (primary)**: host keeps an i"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"n-memory monotonic archive log; the\nclient polls `/plugins/dsh-session-pruner/archived` every 3s and"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" only issues\n`refreshList()` + `refreshSubagents()` when a change is reported — sidebar and\ntask pan"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"el stay consistent within seconds, zero RPC when nothing changed.\n- **Full fallback**: every `uiRefr"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"eshSeconds` seconds the client refreshes both\ndata sources anyway (main list via `refreshList()`, ea"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"ch known parent's\nsubagent catalog via `refreshSubagents()`), covering dirty-flag failures\n(older ho"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"st / route unavailable). No page reload needed."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### From npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### From source (development)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"After installing (or upgrading), restart the dsh web daemon to load the new\nversion (`launchctl kick"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"start -k gui/$(id -u)/com.deepseek.dsh-web`) — config\nchanges alone hot-reload without restart."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration (settings panel, hot reload)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"After install, open **Settings → Plugins → 会话生命周期管理** card. All 10 options save with hot reload (no "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"restart). Six everyday options are visible by default; the four low-frequency fallbacks are tucked i"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"nto an \"Advanced\" collapsible section (its title shows an unsaved-changes badge when applicable):"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Scan interval (min) | 60 | reconcile fallback (events are primary) |\n| Capacity cap (sessions) | 4"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"00 | recycle by priority + oldest when exceeded |\n| UI fallback refresh interval (s) | 30 | dirty-fl"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ag primary (3s change poll); full refresh fallback |\n| Archive retention (hours) | 24 | physical del"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ete after retention |\n| Archive mode | archive | archive (recoverable) / delete directly (irreversib"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"le) |\n| Continuable idle archive (days) | 0 | archive after N idle days, 0 = off |\n| Main idle archi"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"ve (days) | 0 | archive after N idle days, 0 = off |\n| Clean main on overflow | off | main participa"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"tes in capacity recycling |\n| One-shot min survival (min) | 3 | newly finished subagents are not cle"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"aned within N minutes (protects finishing/references) |\n| Pin whitelist (session IDs, one per line) "},{"id":"p32s9","text":"| empty | pinned sessions are never auto-cleaned (pin restored sessions immediately) |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The card also shows a live **status line** (30s poll): archive count + earliest\nexpiry, session tota"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"l (+ overflow), last cleanup (count + time), pinned count."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Env vars (fallback, panel wins): `DSH_SESSION_PRUNER_INTERVAL_MS` / `_MAX` / `_CLEAN_MAIN` / `_ARCHI"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"VE_HOURS` / `_ARCHIVE_MODE` / `_CONTINUABLE_IDLE_DAYS` / `_MAIN_IDLE_DAYS` / `_ONE_SHOT_MIN_AGE_MINU"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"TES` / `_PINNED_IDS` (comma-separated)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
